    "arithmetic": "Float32 double-float (hi+lo) straight-alpha division, separable blend, and W3C source-over fold, and the Porter-Duff products and sum, using error-free two-sum and two-product with explicit fma (declared precise so no driver folds or reassociates them), rounded once to Float32 exactly as the CPU oracle; requires no core shaderFloat64 and no 64-bit integer type",
